            <div xml:id="d855">

                <pb facs="0833" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/2010¼</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Adviser on Political Relations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Murray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-23">October 23, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Murray</hi>: I have read with interest your
                    memorandum of October 15 relative to the President’s idea that possibly
                    Palestine should be handled on a trusteeship basis. He also mentioned that to me
                    once briefly in conversation. I am inclined to think that detailed consideration
                    of this should await the Secretary’s return, but in the meantime I shall, if I
                    have an opportunity, attempt to get from the President more background on his
                    thinking on this.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E[<hi rendition="#small-caps">dward</hi>] S[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >tettinius</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
